{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2022-12-06 11:07:00', 'title': "PG&E CUSTOMERS INVITED TO PRE-ENROLL IN GROUNDBREAKING ‘VEHICLE-TO-EVERYTHING' PILOT PROGRAMS, LEVERAGING ELECTRIC VEHICLE BATTERY POWER FOR RESILIENCE BENEFITS AND HELPING REDUCE CUSTOMER BILLS", 'text': "OAKLAND, CALIF.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF A PRE-ENROLLMENT WEBSITE FOR CUSTOMERS INTERESTED IN JOINING THE COMPANY'S THREE UPCOMING VEHICLE-TO-EVERYTHING (V2X) PILOT PROGRAMS."}